1
00:01:35,400 --> 00:01:37,000
What's wrong, Brigade Commander? Something on your mind?

2
00:01:40,120 --> 00:01:41,120
I was thinking...

3
00:01:43,080 --> 00:01:45,080
Guo Zijian had limited intel,

4
00:01:45,240 --> 00:01:46,200
limited troops,

5
00:01:46,600 --> 00:01:47,600
limited equipment,

6
00:01:48,040 --> 00:01:49,600
and limited support.

7
00:01:50,840 --> 00:01:52,320
How did he almost manage

8
00:01:52,320 --> 00:01:53,840
to get me, Long Yuanshan, killed?

9
00:01:56,360 --> 00:01:58,240
I've been wondering about that too.

10
00:01:59,360 --> 00:02:00,880
I think the main reason

11
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:02,640
is because he had Yang Maolin.

12
00:02:03,120 --> 00:02:04,320
Not long ago, Yang Maolin

13
00:02:04,320 --> 00:02:06,200
was our most essential special ops member.

14
00:02:06,520 --> 00:02:08,120
He knows our tactical thinking

15
00:02:08,120 --> 00:02:09,320
and even our methods

16
00:02:09,440 --> 00:02:10,520
like the back of his hand.

17
00:02:11,160 --> 00:02:12,280
So you're saying

18
00:02:13,040 --> 00:02:16,080
that for Guo Zijian's entire operational plan,

19
00:02:16,160 --> 00:02:17,240
Yang Maolin was the absolute core?

20
00:02:17,600 --> 00:02:18,320
Exactly.

21
00:02:18,680 --> 00:02:19,840
And the facts prove it.

22
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:22,520
At the final, crucial moment,

23
00:02:22,520 --> 00:02:24,640
he also played the card of Yang Maolin

24
00:02:24,640 --> 00:02:26,200
being captured to confuse us.

25
00:02:26,920 --> 00:02:27,920
Let me ask you this.

26
00:02:28,600 --> 00:02:30,360
If Guo Zijian wasn't there,

27
00:02:30,840 --> 00:02:32,400
and I gave you three Yang Maolins,

28
00:02:33,400 --> 00:02:35,400
could you achieve this kind of combat result?

29
00:02:39,320 --> 00:02:40,560
That's why I say,

30
00:02:41,440 --> 00:02:42,200
Yang Maolin

31
00:02:42,200 --> 00:02:44,920
may be a major piece on this chessboard,

32
00:02:47,240 --> 00:02:48,600
but Guo Zijian

33
00:02:49,320 --> 00:02:51,360
is not just a piece on the board,

34
00:02:51,640 --> 00:02:52,880
he's also the player.

35
00:02:54,040 --> 00:02:55,920
He controls the entire battle.

36
00:02:58,080 --> 00:02:59,000
That's true.

37
00:03:00,280 --> 00:03:03,160
If that kid Guo Zijian doesn't make a move, fine.

38
00:03:03,320 --> 00:03:05,600
But when he does, he goes for the jugular.

39
00:03:06,120 --> 00:03:07,560
I remember during the last exercise,

40
00:03:07,840 --> 00:03:10,120
the first time, we were almost completely wiped out by him.

41
00:03:10,600 --> 00:03:11,560
The second time,

42
00:03:11,640 --> 00:03:14,040
thanks to a trap set specifically for him,

43
00:03:14,360 --> 00:03:15,800
we managed to exploit a time gap,

44
00:03:15,800 --> 00:03:16,920
and won by a narrow margin.

45
00:03:19,640 --> 00:03:20,440
Exactly.

46
00:03:21,280 --> 00:03:22,240
Therefore,

47
00:03:23,120 --> 00:03:24,200
in this battle,

48
00:03:25,200 --> 00:03:27,080
we won by pure luck.

49
00:03:27,400 --> 00:03:29,800
Thinking about it now sends a chill down my spine.

50
00:03:30,280 --> 00:03:31,840
If this were a real battle,

51
00:03:31,960 --> 00:03:33,800
we might have already been taken out.

52
00:03:35,120 --> 00:03:36,000
Don't be fooled by the fact

53
00:03:36,400 --> 00:03:38,480
that this was a small-scale decapitation strike.

54
00:03:39,520 --> 00:03:40,440
I have a feeling

55
00:03:40,920 --> 00:03:42,480
that in future combat,

56
00:03:42,480 --> 00:03:44,520
once this tactic is scaled up,

57
00:03:44,760 --> 00:03:47,320
it will very likely trigger

58
00:03:47,320 --> 00:03:48,320
massive turbulence across the battlefield.

59
00:03:48,480 --> 00:03:51,280
And Guo Zijian is making

60
00:03:51,400 --> 00:03:53,920
substantial progress toward a form of warfare

61
00:03:54,840 --> 00:03:56,240
I can't even foresee yet.

62
00:03:56,880 --> 00:04:00,080
I think you rate Guo Zijian too highly.

63
00:04:01,120 --> 00:04:02,600
Our victory this time,

64
00:04:02,960 --> 00:04:04,040
as you said,

65
00:04:04,040 --> 00:04:05,960
might have involved a bit of luck.

66
00:04:06,640 --> 00:04:08,520
But in a duel between true masters,

67
00:04:08,640 --> 00:04:10,080
victory or defeat is decided in an instant.

68
00:04:10,440 --> 00:04:13,080
One second is enough to change the entire battle.

69
00:04:13,280 --> 00:04:14,880
Whoever controls that one second

70
00:04:14,880 --> 00:04:17,240
holds the key to the door of victory.

71
00:04:17,720 --> 00:04:18,320
In this battle,

72
00:04:18,800 --> 00:04:20,320
the key is in our hands.

73
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:23,720
We can't expect Lady Luck

74
00:04:23,760 --> 00:04:25,000
to favor us forever.

75
00:04:25,600 --> 00:04:27,720
So regarding Guo Zijian's tactics,

76
00:04:28,280 --> 00:04:30,960
we must repeatedly study and review them.

77
00:04:32,400 --> 00:04:33,520
Only then

78
00:04:34,800 --> 00:04:36,760
can we keep that one second

79
00:04:36,760 --> 00:04:38,640
firmly in our own hands.

80
00:04:47,600 --> 00:04:48,200
One second.

81
00:04:48,600 --> 00:04:49,600
We were just one second away from taking down

82
00:04:49,600 --> 00:04:50,560
the leader of Black Mamba.

83
00:04:52,080 --> 00:04:54,080
Let me tell you, if we'd pulled that off,

84
00:04:54,080 --> 00:04:55,320
I could've bragged about it for a century.

85
00:04:55,520 --> 00:04:56,360
Show some ambition.

86
00:04:57,960 --> 00:04:59,480
We're all going to be the special ops'

87
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:00,280
elite tech specialists.

88
00:05:01,320 --> 00:05:02,400
Black Mamba is nothing.

89
00:05:02,520 --> 00:05:03,520
Do you know Di Yunfeng?

90
00:05:03,880 --> 00:05:04,720
I know him.

91
00:05:05,120 --> 00:05:06,720
The commander of the ace Blue Force.

92
00:05:06,840 --> 00:05:08,240
He has an undefeated record.

93
00:05:08,280 --> 00:05:08,920
Exactly.

94
00:05:09,160 --> 00:05:09,480
Right?

95
00:05:09,840 --> 00:05:10,880
Since we're setting goals,

96
00:05:11,120 --> 00:05:12,160
we should aim high.

97
00:05:12,320 --> 00:05:13,800
Let's take down Di Yunfeng!

98
00:05:13,880 --> 00:05:15,160
Take down Di Yunfeng!

99
00:05:15,600 --> 00:05:16,880
Take down Di Yunfeng!

100
00:05:19,200 --> 00:05:19,920
That's a lot of big talk.

101
00:05:20,680 --> 00:05:23,000
Trying to run before you can walk.

102
00:05:23,520 --> 00:05:25,400
Forget Di Yunfeng's ace Blue Force,

103
00:05:25,760 --> 00:05:26,520
for you guys,

104
00:05:27,360 --> 00:05:29,160
even beating the 404th Brigade would be hard.

105
00:05:29,880 --> 00:05:30,560
Then, Squad Leader,

106
00:05:30,800 --> 00:05:32,000
how many more years do we have to train?

107
00:05:32,400 --> 00:05:33,520
At least 20 years.

108
00:05:33,800 --> 00:05:34,760
20 years?

109
00:05:35,360 --> 00:05:35,920
Squad Leader,

110
00:05:36,400 --> 00:05:37,680
we're only 20 years old.

111
00:05:38,040 --> 00:05:39,560
We have plenty of time and energy.

112
00:05:40,040 --> 00:05:40,880
I believe

113
00:05:41,280 --> 00:05:43,000
we will definitely succeed.

114
00:05:43,280 --> 00:05:46,080
We can definitely do it.

115
00:05:46,080 --> 00:05:47,000
Squad Leader...

116
00:06:15,120 --> 00:06:15,800
Battalion Commander Guo.

117
00:06:16,160 --> 00:06:17,120
Welcome back.

118
00:06:24,400 --> 00:06:26,000
Fall in!

119
00:06:33,720 --> 00:06:34,480
We're here! We're here!

120
00:06:36,360 --> 00:06:37,440
Keep up in the back!

121
00:06:49,320 --> 00:06:50,720
Have some water.

122
00:06:51,760 --> 00:06:52,600
No drinking.

123
00:06:55,160 --> 00:06:56,720
I know you're all very thirsty right now.

124
00:06:57,000 --> 00:06:58,080
But endurance

125
00:06:58,080 --> 00:06:59,840
is also part of today's training.

126
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:01,040
Each of you

127
00:07:01,040 --> 00:07:02,960
has less than a third of a canteen of water left.

128
00:07:02,960 --> 00:07:03,960
Check it carefully.

129
00:07:04,880 --> 00:07:05,360
Captain,

130
00:07:06,840 --> 00:07:08,400
can I just lick it to moisten my lips?

131
00:07:08,400 --> 00:07:08,800
Is that okay?

132
00:07:08,800 --> 00:07:09,880
Yeah, Captain.

133
00:07:10,400 --> 00:07:12,120
No. Nice try.

134
00:07:12,720 --> 00:07:14,320
You have five minutes to rest.

135
00:07:14,640 --> 00:07:16,120
Prepare for the next training exercise.

136
00:07:16,760 --> 00:07:17,720
We're out of energy, Captain.

137
00:07:20,960 --> 00:07:21,560
Captain Wang.

138
00:07:24,320 --> 00:07:24,880
Understood.

139
00:07:26,240 --> 00:07:27,240
What is the exact location?

140
00:07:30,240 --> 00:07:30,640
Roger that.

141
00:07:30,920 --> 00:07:31,880
We'll head out immediately.

142
00:07:33,040 --> 00:07:33,480
Fall in!

143
00:07:39,080 --> 00:07:39,880
Emergency mission!

144
00:07:40,920 --> 00:07:42,560
Six college students went hiking

145
00:07:42,840 --> 00:07:44,360
and stumbled into the Cliff of No Return.

146
00:07:44,640 --> 00:07:45,760
One of them is currently injured.

147
00:07:46,200 --> 00:07:47,200
The local police station

148
00:07:47,560 --> 00:07:49,120
is coordinating a rescue operation,

149
00:07:49,640 --> 00:07:51,360
but our squad is much closer.

150
00:07:51,640 --> 00:07:52,920
Due to the urgency of the situation,

151
00:07:53,120 --> 00:07:55,560
our superiors ordered us to execute the rescue immediately.

152
00:08:06,920 --> 00:08:07,760
How is it?

153
00:08:08,400 --> 00:08:08,920
My foot.

154
00:08:11,240 --> 00:08:12,120
I think it's broken.

155
00:08:12,120 --> 00:08:13,280
Hang in there.

156
00:08:13,680 --> 00:08:14,520
Have some water first.

157
00:08:15,240 --> 00:08:16,160
Soldiers,

158
00:08:17,320 --> 00:08:18,280
Do you have any water?

159
00:08:18,280 --> 00:08:19,520
My canteen is empty.

160
00:08:19,520 --> 00:08:20,640
Can we drink from your canteens?

161
00:08:21,880 --> 00:08:23,000
Unhook your canteens.

162
00:08:46,640 --> 00:08:47,240
Ready!

163
00:08:47,560 --> 00:08:48,280
Pull!

164
00:09:04,960 --> 00:09:05,640
Come on, easy now.

165
00:09:07,840 --> 00:09:09,080
Watch the leg. You okay?

166
00:09:17,160 --> 00:09:17,800
Okay.

167
00:09:17,800 --> 00:09:18,440
Pull!

168
00:09:29,560 --> 00:09:30,200
Are you okay?

169
00:09:30,440 --> 00:09:31,040
I'm fine.

170
00:09:32,120 --> 00:09:33,960
Captain, is there any water left?

171
00:09:34,880 --> 00:09:35,600
Got any water?

172
00:09:37,200 --> 00:09:37,840
We're out.

173
00:09:40,160 --> 00:09:42,320
You still have some water, right?

174
00:09:43,040 --> 00:09:43,600
I...

175
00:09:43,960 --> 00:09:45,360
If I had water, why would I ask you?

176
00:09:49,920 --> 00:09:50,920
Alright, get ready to head down.

177
00:10:03,640 --> 00:10:04,480
Give me the bag.

178
00:10:06,720 --> 00:10:07,440
Uncle Lin.

179
00:10:09,080 --> 00:10:10,080
We've already reached the foot of the mountain.

180
00:10:10,840 --> 00:10:11,960
All right, all right.

181
00:10:12,600 --> 00:10:13,200
Okay.

182
00:10:14,320 --> 00:10:15,280
Guys,

183
00:10:15,640 --> 00:10:16,920
It's all sorted.

184
00:10:17,040 --> 00:10:18,560
A helicopter will be here to pick us up soon.

185
00:10:19,200 --> 00:10:19,560
How about that?

186
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:21,360
Never been in a helicopter before, right?

187
00:10:26,440 --> 00:10:29,680
You came up the path on the west side, right?

188
00:10:30,880 --> 00:10:32,200
I think so.

189
00:10:32,560 --> 00:10:34,320
Do you know this is a military restricted zone?

190
00:10:35,320 --> 00:10:35,800
Is it?

191
00:10:36,240 --> 00:10:36,520
Well...

192
00:10:37,600 --> 00:10:38,400
I didn't know.

193
00:10:39,160 --> 00:10:39,840
You didn't know?

194
00:10:40,560 --> 00:10:41,360
You just said

195
00:10:41,360 --> 00:10:42,840
you came up the path on the west side.

196
00:10:43,200 --> 00:10:45,440
There's a sign right there that says it clearly.

197
00:10:45,440 --> 00:10:46,040
Didn't you see it?

198
00:10:46,240 --> 00:10:47,160
Well, we...

199
00:10:49,760 --> 00:10:50,640
Soldier,

200
00:10:51,440 --> 00:10:52,040
is this really necessary?

201
00:10:52,880 --> 00:10:54,560
This is just the middle of nowhere.

202
00:10:55,080 --> 00:10:57,120
I've seen plenty of restricted zones like this.

203
00:10:57,320 --> 00:11:00,120
We caused you trouble today.

204
00:11:00,480 --> 00:11:01,640
It won't happen again.

205
00:11:03,960 --> 00:11:05,880
Your gear looks pretty professional.

206
00:11:06,720 --> 00:11:07,800
Don't you have any common sense?

207
00:11:08,240 --> 00:11:09,720
If something happened to you,

208
00:11:10,160 --> 00:11:11,080
what would your families do?

209
00:11:15,960 --> 00:11:17,080
Soldier,

210
00:11:17,320 --> 00:11:19,560
you helped us out today.

211
00:11:19,720 --> 00:11:20,480
Thank you.

212
00:11:21,080 --> 00:11:24,440
I'll have someone send you a commendation banner later.

213
00:11:24,840 --> 00:11:26,760
Just tell me if there's anything else you need help with.

214
00:11:26,760 --> 00:11:27,400
I'll do my best.

215
00:11:28,320 --> 00:11:30,000
Big words for someone so young.

216
00:11:30,240 --> 00:11:32,160
Soldier, you don't know this,

217
00:11:32,160 --> 00:11:33,040
but his dad is...

218
00:11:39,400 --> 00:11:40,080
Kid,

219
00:11:40,360 --> 00:11:41,200
let me remind you,

220
00:11:41,680 --> 00:11:43,080
this is a military restricted zone.

221
00:11:43,680 --> 00:11:44,560
No matter who your dad is,

222
00:11:45,200 --> 00:11:47,160
a private helicopter is absolutely not getting in here.

223
00:11:48,120 --> 00:11:49,160
Wait until our vehicle arrives,

224
00:11:49,360 --> 00:11:50,320
and we'll drive you down.

225
00:11:50,920 --> 00:11:51,360
Fall in!

226
00:11:51,480 --> 00:11:53,040
Ignore him. It's fine.

227
00:11:53,400 --> 00:11:54,320
We still have over an hour.

228
00:11:54,680 --> 00:11:55,800
Let's eat something hot first.

229
00:11:59,960 --> 00:12:01,400
I know everyone is very thirsty.

230
00:12:01,600 --> 00:12:02,680
Just hang in there a little longer.

231
00:12:03,480 --> 00:12:04,640
How long until the vehicle gets here?

232
00:12:05,120 --> 00:12:05,920
20 minutes.

233
00:12:20,040 --> 00:12:20,760
Young man.

234
00:12:21,360 --> 00:12:22,120
Put out the fire.

235
00:12:22,320 --> 00:12:22,960
Why?

236
00:12:23,440 --> 00:12:23,920
First,

237
00:12:24,800 --> 00:12:26,280
this is a military administrative zone.

238
00:12:26,600 --> 00:12:28,760
Butane canisters are highly flammable.

239
00:12:29,040 --> 00:12:31,400
They are prohibited here without permission.

240
00:12:31,480 --> 00:12:31,760
Second,

241
00:12:32,080 --> 00:12:33,240
this is a forest.

242
00:12:33,240 --> 00:12:34,080
Open flames are strictly prohibited.

243
00:12:35,080 --> 00:12:36,160
This canister of mine

244
00:12:36,640 --> 00:12:37,680
is imported.

245
00:12:37,920 --> 00:12:39,720
It wouldn't explode even if you shot it.

246
00:12:40,320 --> 00:12:41,120
Besides,

247
00:12:41,320 --> 00:12:42,880
there are no plants or grass around here.

248
00:12:43,200 --> 00:12:44,400
And with so many people watching,

249
00:12:45,120 --> 00:12:46,400
it's fine. It won't catch fire.

250
00:12:46,600 --> 00:12:47,760
I am now ordering you

251
00:12:48,080 --> 00:12:49,000
to put out the fire.

252
00:12:52,680 --> 00:12:54,400
Watch your attitude.

253
00:12:56,000 --> 00:12:57,000
I'm not bragging,

254
00:12:57,320 --> 00:12:58,120
but on this mountain,

255
00:12:58,720 --> 00:12:59,680
one phone call from me

256
00:13:00,120 --> 00:13:01,200
clears the way.

257
00:13:02,240 --> 00:13:04,080
Just put it out like the PLA asked.

258
00:13:07,000 --> 00:13:07,960
What year are you in?

259
00:13:08,200 --> 00:13:09,040
Senior.

260
00:13:09,040 --> 00:13:09,680
Why?

261
00:13:11,600 --> 00:13:13,600
The soldier who just helped you down,

262
00:13:14,640 --> 00:13:16,360
that same soldier, is a sophomore.

263
00:13:16,560 --> 00:13:18,040
He's younger than you.

264
00:13:19,280 --> 00:13:20,520
When you said you were thirsty,

265
00:13:20,960 --> 00:13:22,200
he and his comrades

266
00:13:22,320 --> 00:13:23,640
gave you their water without hesitation.

267
00:13:24,080 --> 00:13:24,920
You should know,

268
00:13:24,920 --> 00:13:26,280
they trained all morning

269
00:13:26,280 --> 00:13:27,200
without drinking a single drop.

270
00:13:27,440 --> 00:13:28,440
You're soldiers.

271
00:13:28,560 --> 00:13:29,600
This is what you're supposed to do.

272
00:13:29,760 --> 00:13:31,200
Soldiers are human too.

273
00:13:31,560 --> 00:13:32,920
We need to eat and drink too.

274
00:13:34,000 --> 00:13:35,240
Our soldiers

275
00:13:35,440 --> 00:13:37,440
almost collapsed from exhaustion saving you.

276
00:13:37,920 --> 00:13:39,360
I just asked if you had water,

277
00:13:39,360 --> 00:13:40,360
and you actually said no.

278
00:13:40,800 --> 00:13:42,120
The water is mine.

279
00:13:42,880 --> 00:13:44,840
I can do whatever I want with it.

280
00:13:45,560 --> 00:13:46,440
What's it to you?

281
00:13:50,080 --> 00:13:51,440
Is this how your teachers and parents

282
00:13:51,440 --> 00:13:52,720
taught you to behave?

283
00:13:56,000 --> 00:13:58,520
How my teachers and parents teach me

284
00:13:58,960 --> 00:14:00,600
is none of your business.

285
00:14:02,320 --> 00:14:03,720
Since they didn't teach you,

286
00:14:04,520 --> 00:14:05,600
I'll teach you.

287
00:14:10,000 --> 00:14:10,680
Yang Maolin!

288
00:14:10,920 --> 00:14:11,440
Here!

289
00:14:12,120 --> 00:14:13,640
Confiscate this canister!

290
00:14:14,720 --> 00:14:15,200
Yes, sir!

291
00:14:19,000 --> 00:14:21,400
Currently, a video is going viral online.

292
00:14:21,600 --> 00:14:23,280
A PLA major

293
00:14:23,360 --> 00:14:25,600
violently kicked away a civilian's cooking pot.

294
00:14:29,520 --> 00:14:30,920
Staff Officer Liang! Staff Officer Liang!

295
00:14:30,920 --> 00:14:32,040
We have a huge problem!

296
00:14:32,120 --> 00:14:32,880
What is it now?

297
00:14:32,880 --> 00:14:34,760
"PLA major fails to get water,

298
00:14:34,880 --> 00:14:35,960
kicks over hikers' cookware."

299
00:14:39,880 --> 00:14:41,040
Wait, wait, wait.

300
00:14:41,040 --> 00:14:42,360
There's worse. Let me find it.

301
00:14:44,240 --> 00:14:45,160
There's even a video here.

302
00:14:46,160 --> 00:14:46,960
There's even a video of Guo Zijian

303
00:14:46,960 --> 00:14:48,720
kicking over their picnic pot.

304
00:14:54,800 --> 00:14:56,720
Guo Zijian is in huge trouble this time.

305
00:15:04,040 --> 00:15:04,880
Overnight,

306
00:15:05,640 --> 00:15:06,760
it's everywhere.

307
00:15:07,320 --> 00:15:09,280
My phone has been blowing up non-stop.

308
00:15:09,680 --> 00:15:10,520
Turn it off. Turn it off.

309
00:15:10,920 --> 00:15:11,640
It's already off.

310
00:15:13,040 --> 00:15:14,040
Even the Military Commission's online

311
00:15:14,320 --> 00:15:15,560
public opinion department has been alerted.

312
00:15:16,240 --> 00:15:19,200
Yesterday's public opinion situation was very grim.

313
00:15:22,560 --> 00:15:23,520
Great.

314
00:15:25,400 --> 00:15:26,920
The people's soldiers

315
00:15:27,360 --> 00:15:29,360
kicked the people's cooking pot.

316
00:15:31,080 --> 00:15:32,240
You really made me proud.

317
00:15:33,200 --> 00:15:34,240
I didn't expect

318
00:15:34,520 --> 00:15:36,440
that in a place as isolated as the Training Unit,

319
00:15:36,440 --> 00:15:37,440
you'd still manage to cause trouble.

320
00:15:39,120 --> 00:15:39,880
Sirs,

321
00:15:40,520 --> 00:15:41,800
the truth speaks for itself.

322
00:15:42,000 --> 00:15:43,400
I've already explained the situation clearly.

323
00:15:43,640 --> 00:15:44,440
Explained it clearly?

324
00:15:46,440 --> 00:15:48,440
Then what are we doing here right now?

325
00:15:48,440 --> 00:15:49,360
Playing games with you?

326
00:15:50,840 --> 00:15:52,120
You were originally in the right,

327
00:15:52,240 --> 00:15:53,160
but with that kick,

328
00:15:53,400 --> 00:15:55,040
you can't explain yourself even with a hundred mouths.

329
00:15:56,320 --> 00:15:57,040
Ultimately,

330
00:15:58,560 --> 00:15:59,560
you're still immature.

331
00:16:05,400 --> 00:16:05,880
Reporting.

332
00:16:05,920 --> 00:16:06,240
Come in.

333
00:16:09,080 --> 00:16:09,440
Commissar.

334
00:16:09,800 --> 00:16:11,200
Director Wang from the Propaganda Department is here.

335
00:16:17,640 --> 00:16:19,240
Right now, we still don't know

336
00:16:19,280 --> 00:16:20,640
the details of this incident.

337
00:16:21,240 --> 00:16:22,320
But no matter the reason,

338
00:16:22,600 --> 00:16:24,160
as a soldier of the people,

339
00:16:24,600 --> 00:16:26,680
you shouldn't have done such a thing.

340
00:16:27,040 --> 00:16:28,360
If a war really breaks out,

341
00:16:28,880 --> 00:16:29,800
how can soldiers like this

342
00:16:30,120 --> 00:16:31,840
protect our lives and property?

343
00:16:35,080 --> 00:16:36,040
This is not a major incident,

344
00:16:36,560 --> 00:16:37,720
but its impact is quite significant.

345
00:16:39,520 --> 00:16:42,200
Even high-ranking commanders

346
00:16:42,200 --> 00:16:43,560
have started paying attention to public opinion.

347
00:16:44,640 --> 00:16:45,480
However,

348
00:16:45,480 --> 00:16:47,400
the Group Army leaders are not foolish,

349
00:16:47,640 --> 00:16:49,320
and won't blindly follow the uproar.

350
00:16:50,280 --> 00:16:52,560
The most important thing is to get the facts straight.

351
00:16:52,640 --> 00:16:54,240
We'll deal with everything else later.

352
00:16:54,640 --> 00:16:57,040
We reported the truth of the matter overnight.

353
00:16:57,920 --> 00:16:59,760
The Group Army has received the report.

354
00:17:00,240 --> 00:17:02,440
We've contacted the relevant news agencies

355
00:17:02,480 --> 00:17:04,000
to interview the rescued college students,

356
00:17:04,040 --> 00:17:05,480
so they can explain what really happened.

357
00:17:06,440 --> 00:17:07,480
That's great.

358
00:17:08,400 --> 00:17:09,800
Don't get your hopes up too much.

359
00:17:10,760 --> 00:17:12,280
Battles in the court of public opinion

360
00:17:12,480 --> 00:17:13,160
are more complex than reality,

361
00:17:13,160 --> 00:17:15,160
even more so than battles on the frontlines.

362
00:17:16,119 --> 00:17:17,920
Without concrete evidence,

363
00:17:18,000 --> 00:17:19,720
just the explanations of a few people

364
00:17:19,800 --> 00:17:21,920
won't be very convincing.

365
00:17:22,520 --> 00:17:24,839
What's more, those college students are facing

366
00:17:25,200 --> 00:17:27,280
their classmates they see every day.

367
00:17:28,000 --> 00:17:30,200
And even if they do speak up,

368
00:17:30,400 --> 00:17:31,440
people could just say

369
00:17:31,440 --> 00:17:33,120
that we used other methods

370
00:17:33,360 --> 00:17:34,320
to coerce them into it.

371
00:17:36,600 --> 00:17:38,160
Some people finally caught an opportunity

372
00:17:38,160 --> 00:17:39,880
to sling mud at the military,

373
00:17:40,160 --> 00:17:41,360
and they won't let it go easily.

374
00:17:41,720 --> 00:17:43,120
Doesn't that complicate things?

375
00:17:43,440 --> 00:17:43,840
Therefore,

376
00:17:44,280 --> 00:17:45,360
evidence is very important,

377
00:17:45,720 --> 00:17:47,000
especially video evidence.

378
00:17:47,880 --> 00:17:48,520
But

379
00:17:48,960 --> 00:17:50,800
we don't have surveillance cameras in that area.

380
00:17:51,000 --> 00:17:51,920
Where are we supposed to find this evidence?

381
00:17:52,560 --> 00:17:53,160
Old Wang,

382
00:17:54,480 --> 00:17:55,760
are there any other options?

383
00:17:57,720 --> 00:17:59,760
I can't think of any good ideas right now.

384
00:17:59,840 --> 00:18:00,480
Wait,

385
00:18:01,760 --> 00:18:03,240
so we just watch it blow up?

386
00:18:03,600 --> 00:18:05,080
We can only wait and see for now.

387
00:18:05,480 --> 00:18:07,680
Let's see if things take a new turn.

388
00:18:09,280 --> 00:18:10,200
This is a disaster.

389
00:18:11,360 --> 00:18:13,080
I originally thought this Guo Zijian

390
00:18:13,320 --> 00:18:15,680
just had some character flaws.

391
00:18:16,880 --> 00:18:18,720
But in terms of basic military qualities,

392
00:18:18,880 --> 00:18:20,280
he should still be solid.

393
00:18:20,840 --> 00:18:21,920
But I really didn't expect this.

394
00:18:23,000 --> 00:18:24,160
It's so disappointing.

395
00:18:27,320 --> 00:18:28,080
Deputy Brigade Commander Suo,

396
00:18:29,000 --> 00:18:29,480
Deputy Brigade Commander Suo.

397
00:18:35,120 --> 00:18:37,600
However, this happening to him

398
00:18:38,440 --> 00:18:39,480
isn't too surprising.

399
00:18:40,000 --> 00:18:42,720
After all, compared to his other bad behavior,

400
00:18:43,120 --> 00:18:44,200
this is nothing.

401
00:18:44,600 --> 00:18:45,240
But it is highly likely

402
00:18:45,280 --> 00:18:47,520
to be the straw that breaks the camel's back.

403
00:18:51,600 --> 00:18:52,320
Deputy Brigade Commander Suo,

404
00:18:52,600 --> 00:18:54,920
you see, in the current public opinion environment,

405
00:18:55,320 --> 00:18:56,080
if we continue to

406
00:18:56,080 --> 00:18:58,040
let him stay as an instructor in the Training Unit,

407
00:18:59,680 --> 00:19:00,720
is it appropriate?

408
00:19:01,320 --> 00:19:03,840
Shouldn't we give the public an explanation?

409
00:19:04,240 --> 00:19:05,280
Guo Zijian was indeed

410
00:19:06,360 --> 00:19:07,920
way too impulsive this time.

411
00:19:08,800 --> 00:19:10,400
But we have to look at the facts.

412
00:19:11,320 --> 00:19:13,560
We must uphold the military's image

413
00:19:13,880 --> 00:19:15,760
and protect the unit's dignity.

414
00:19:16,480 --> 00:19:18,840
If we handle this too hastily,

415
00:19:19,280 --> 00:19:21,280
it might affect a soldier's future.

416
00:19:22,080 --> 00:19:23,240
But I've said this before,

417
00:19:23,720 --> 00:19:26,320
this kid was bound to make a huge mistake.

418
00:19:27,800 --> 00:19:30,120
It would've been fine if it was within our unit,

419
00:19:31,080 --> 00:19:32,640
at least we could cover for him.

420
00:19:33,760 --> 00:19:34,320
But this time,

421
00:19:34,320 --> 00:19:36,040
he messed up in front of the public.

422
00:19:36,880 --> 00:19:38,360
Who's going to cover that up?

423
00:19:38,680 --> 00:19:39,040
That's enough.

424
00:19:39,040 --> 00:19:40,440
Stop worrying about this.

425
00:19:42,720 --> 00:19:44,200
As for how to deal with him,

426
00:19:44,800 --> 00:19:45,600
our Party Committee

427
00:19:46,640 --> 00:19:47,760
will discuss it thoroughly.

428
00:19:48,840 --> 00:19:49,400
All right.

429
00:19:50,080 --> 00:19:51,040
I'll head out now.

430
00:19:59,600 --> 00:20:01,600
Dad, these are the profiles I collected

431
00:20:01,600 --> 00:20:03,040
of top internet influencers.

432
00:20:03,040 --> 00:20:04,760
They all have over a million followers.

433
00:20:05,200 --> 00:20:06,920
I've already reached out

434
00:20:06,920 --> 00:20:07,800
to a few of them

435
00:20:07,880 --> 00:20:09,320
and come to a preliminary agreement.

436
00:20:10,080 --> 00:20:13,120
Here is a detailed counterattack strategy.

437
00:20:13,440 --> 00:20:14,840
I refuse to believe

438
00:20:15,120 --> 00:20:16,880
there's no justice in this world.

439
00:20:16,880 --> 00:20:18,880
We can't let my brother get ruined by these kids.

440
00:20:22,560 --> 00:20:23,720
A counterattack strategy?

441
00:20:24,240 --> 00:20:25,280
Let's hear it, then.

442
00:20:26,520 --> 00:20:27,480
Step one.

443
00:20:27,480 --> 00:20:29,560
We first get the influencers to shoot

444
00:20:29,560 --> 00:20:30,800
mid-length and short videos

445
00:20:30,800 --> 00:20:32,480
about my brother's pot-kicking incident,

446
00:20:32,480 --> 00:20:34,520
analyzing it from different angles.

447
00:20:34,800 --> 00:20:35,560
Step two.

448
00:20:35,760 --> 00:20:37,560
Dig deep into these students' backgrounds,

449
00:20:37,640 --> 00:20:39,040
especially their family backgrounds.

450
00:20:39,240 --> 00:20:41,680
We magnify any dirt we find

451
00:20:41,680 --> 00:20:42,960
to divert public attention.

452
00:20:43,480 --> 00:20:44,080
Third.

453
00:20:44,520 --> 00:20:46,560
Publicize my brother's excellent record

454
00:20:46,560 --> 00:20:47,520
and portray him as

455
00:20:47,640 --> 00:20:49,680
a strong soldier who was wronged.

456
00:20:50,440 --> 00:20:51,600
The most important step:

457
00:20:52,520 --> 00:20:53,800
Find these students

458
00:20:54,080 --> 00:20:56,280
and talk to them individually

459
00:20:56,320 --> 00:20:58,280
to break up their group from the inside.

460
00:20:58,560 --> 00:20:59,960
You've thought this through.

461
00:21:02,240 --> 00:21:04,560
Tell me, how much will this cost?

462
00:21:05,240 --> 00:21:07,280
Isn't that what I'm here to discuss?

463
00:21:07,360 --> 00:21:09,320
As long as we can save my brother's reputation,

464
00:21:09,360 --> 00:21:10,320
it's worth any price.

465
00:21:22,880 --> 00:21:23,640
Manager Huang,

466
00:21:25,320 --> 00:21:26,480
starting this month,

467
00:21:27,520 --> 00:21:29,480
stop paying Chen Xiaoshan's salary.

468
00:21:29,800 --> 00:21:30,120
Dad!

469
00:21:30,120 --> 00:21:33,000
All the project funds she requested,

470
00:21:33,360 --> 00:21:34,440
stop them right now.

471
00:21:35,680 --> 00:21:37,520
Dad, my projects can't stop!

472
00:21:37,560 --> 00:21:38,840
I still have credit card bills to pay!

473
00:21:39,360 --> 00:21:41,160
Aren't you quite resourceful?

474
00:21:41,200 --> 00:21:42,320
Figure it out yourself.

475
00:21:42,360 --> 00:21:43,000
Dad!

476
00:21:44,800 --> 00:21:46,840
Where did you learn these crooked tricks?

477
00:21:48,080 --> 00:21:50,880
These are legitimate strategies from a PR firm!

478
00:21:51,320 --> 00:21:52,600
Some PR firm.

479
00:21:52,600 --> 00:21:53,800
It's exactly people like them

480
00:21:53,880 --> 00:21:56,360
who are making a mess of the internet.

481
00:21:56,520 --> 00:21:57,400
You think you're so smart.

482
00:21:57,800 --> 00:21:59,280
You have no idea how crazy

483
00:21:59,280 --> 00:22:00,560
things are on the internet right now!

484
00:22:00,560 --> 00:22:02,880
If we don't intervene, my brother is finished!

485
00:22:03,960 --> 00:22:05,240
The military has its discipline.

486
00:22:06,000 --> 00:22:08,320
They won't wrongly accuse a good man.

487
00:22:09,280 --> 00:22:11,480
You want to use these dirty tricks

488
00:22:11,680 --> 00:22:12,960
to clear your brother's name?

489
00:22:14,200 --> 00:22:15,280
You're only making it worse!

490
00:22:15,280 --> 00:22:16,360
Just go.

491
00:22:16,720 --> 00:22:18,840
Don't meddle in your brother's business.

492
00:22:19,240 --> 00:22:20,280
Some PR firm...

493
00:22:20,640 --> 00:22:21,720
Bullshit firm.

494
00:22:25,720 --> 00:22:29,240
Then please tell Manager Huang about my funds...

495
00:22:32,000 --> 00:22:32,600
Just go.

496
00:22:33,920 --> 00:22:35,280
My...

497
00:22:35,280 --> 00:22:36,520
funds...

498
00:22:36,880 --> 00:22:37,880
Manager Huang...

499
00:22:50,760 --> 00:22:51,560
Zijian.

500
00:22:52,360 --> 00:22:53,320
Never mind you,

501
00:22:54,080 --> 00:22:54,840
if it were me,

502
00:22:55,480 --> 00:22:56,960
I would've kicked him too.

503
00:22:57,720 --> 00:22:59,880
I might've even kicked him a few more times.

504
00:23:01,160 --> 00:23:02,000
Things for you now

505
00:23:02,000 --> 00:23:03,800
are different from when I served.

506
00:23:04,400 --> 00:23:06,440
Back then, we had no cell phones,

507
00:23:06,440 --> 00:23:07,280
no internet.

508
00:23:07,600 --> 00:23:09,640
Incidents like this rarely happened.

509
00:23:11,000 --> 00:23:12,000
But,

510
00:23:12,560 --> 00:23:13,320
Zijian,

511
00:23:13,760 --> 00:23:14,720
I have to remind you,

512
00:23:15,800 --> 00:23:17,240
this incident

513
00:23:17,560 --> 00:23:18,240
might

514
00:23:18,800 --> 00:23:21,160
have an impact on your military career.

515
00:23:21,400 --> 00:23:22,680
If not handled properly,

516
00:23:23,120 --> 00:23:26,160
you might be removed from your core post,

517
00:23:26,200 --> 00:23:27,840
or even marginalized.

518
00:23:28,680 --> 00:23:29,840
If that really happens,

519
00:23:30,640 --> 00:23:32,120
I'll go back and work for you.

520
00:23:32,200 --> 00:23:33,280
I'll find another way

521
00:23:33,360 --> 00:23:34,880
to keep contributing to the army.

522
00:23:35,320 --> 00:23:35,920
Zijian,

523
00:23:36,320 --> 00:23:37,120
let me tell you,

524
00:23:37,680 --> 00:23:40,400
even if you have to leave the army one day,

525
00:23:41,000 --> 00:23:42,680
you must do it with dignity,

526
00:23:42,800 --> 00:23:44,640
and leave with your head held high.

527
00:23:45,360 --> 00:23:47,560
You absolutely can't have any stains on your record.

528
00:23:47,720 --> 00:23:49,800
Otherwise, for the rest of your life,

529
00:23:49,880 --> 00:23:51,200
you'll never be at peace.

530
00:23:51,960 --> 00:23:52,600
I understand.

531
00:24:06,880 --> 00:24:07,720
Captain Wang.

532
00:24:09,920 --> 00:24:10,520
Old Guo.

533
00:24:13,880 --> 00:24:15,120
It just came down from the brigade.

534
00:24:21,880 --> 00:24:23,320
The Brigade Party Committee has decided

535
00:24:23,680 --> 00:24:26,000
that effective immediately, Comrade Guo Zijian is suspended

536
00:24:26,000 --> 00:24:27,200
from all teaching duties.

537
00:24:29,040 --> 00:24:29,680
Looks like I'm

538
00:24:30,120 --> 00:24:31,200
getting another vacation.

539
00:24:31,680 --> 00:24:32,800
Come on.

540
00:24:32,840 --> 00:24:34,240
The document clearly states

541
00:24:34,240 --> 00:24:35,400
it's only a suspension.

542
00:24:35,920 --> 00:24:38,000
Once this blows over, you'll be fine.

543
00:24:39,880 --> 00:24:41,480
Don't take it to heart.

544
00:24:42,360 --> 00:24:43,440
Kids these days,

545
00:24:43,720 --> 00:24:45,160
all they do is spend their time online.

546
00:24:45,160 --> 00:24:46,200
They ignore the good stuff

547
00:24:46,760 --> 00:24:48,280
and only pick up bad habits.

548
00:24:49,680 --> 00:24:51,200
I can't blame those students.

549
00:24:51,800 --> 00:24:53,680
I really did kick their pot over.

550
00:24:53,800 --> 00:24:55,200
They have proof.

551
00:24:55,560 --> 00:24:57,120
Videos and eyewitnesses.

552
00:24:58,600 --> 00:24:59,720
Just my bad luck.

553
00:25:01,120 --> 00:25:01,880
It's fine.

554
00:25:03,920 --> 00:25:04,880
I'm off.

555
00:25:17,240 --> 00:25:19,320
Staff Officer Liang! Staff Officer Liang!

556
00:25:20,400 --> 00:25:22,800
There's an update on Guo Zijian's incident.

557
00:25:26,600 --> 00:25:28,520
I'm the college student whose

558
00:25:28,520 --> 00:25:30,000
rice pot was kicked away by the PLA.

559
00:25:30,400 --> 00:25:31,360
A while ago,

560
00:25:31,640 --> 00:25:33,280
someone sent me another direct message.

561
00:25:33,640 --> 00:25:36,000
They claimed to be a veteran

562
00:25:36,320 --> 00:25:37,400
who wanted to talk to me.

563
00:25:37,520 --> 00:25:38,160
But,

564
00:25:38,280 --> 00:25:39,880
he didn't reveal his

565
00:25:39,920 --> 00:25:41,160
real name.

566
00:25:41,440 --> 00:25:43,320
I figure he must be the officer

567
00:25:43,400 --> 00:25:45,360
who kicked my rice pot away.

568
00:25:45,480 --> 00:25:46,640
If not,

569
00:25:47,120 --> 00:25:49,080
he's just someone chasing clout.

570
00:25:51,040 --> 00:25:52,560
I don't know what he wants with me,

571
00:25:52,840 --> 00:25:54,520
and I don't know what we'd talk about.

572
00:25:55,240 --> 00:25:56,240
But I'm guessing,

573
00:25:56,560 --> 00:25:58,280
if it really is that officer,

574
00:25:58,440 --> 00:26:00,480
a fight is probably inevitable.

575
00:26:03,480 --> 00:26:04,600
What do you guys think?

576
00:26:04,920 --> 00:26:06,120
Should I go or not?

577
00:26:07,120 --> 00:26:07,920
I've thought about it,

578
00:26:09,120 --> 00:26:10,360
and I'll go.

579
00:26:10,880 --> 00:26:12,560
To avoid unnecessary trouble,

580
00:26:13,120 --> 00:26:13,720
I

581
00:26:13,960 --> 00:26:15,960
won't be revealing the

582
00:26:16,240 --> 00:26:18,120
exact time and location to you all.

583
00:26:18,800 --> 00:26:20,240
If there's any breaking news,

584
00:26:20,520 --> 00:26:21,760
I'll be sure to

585
00:26:21,840 --> 00:26:22,880
report it to everyone immediately.

586
00:26:23,640 --> 00:26:25,200
If you like my videos,

587
00:26:25,400 --> 00:26:26,240
please hit subscribe.

588
00:26:30,240 --> 00:26:30,800
Staff Officer Liang,

589
00:26:31,680 --> 00:26:33,960
you don't think Guo Zijian will actually fight him?

590
00:26:36,000 --> 00:26:39,560
Hello, the number you dialed is busy.

591
00:26:39,800 --> 00:26:41,080
Please try again later.

592
00:26:42,840 --> 00:26:44,080
Staff Officer Liang, where are you going?

593
00:26:44,880 --> 00:26:45,920
Staff Officer Liang!

594
00:26:51,280 --> 00:26:52,600
You came just for this?

595
00:26:53,880 --> 00:26:55,640
I think as an adult,

596
00:26:56,120 --> 00:26:57,440
and especially as a soldier,

597
00:26:57,440 --> 00:26:58,840
one should act more rationally.

598
00:27:03,600 --> 00:27:05,080
I was wrong to kick the pot.

599
00:27:05,280 --> 00:27:06,240
I was too impulsive.

600
00:27:06,720 --> 00:27:07,720
But I wouldn't go as far as

601
00:27:08,120 --> 00:27:09,960
picking fights with college students to vent.

602
00:27:14,560 --> 00:27:16,600
Could it be one of your soldiers?

603
00:27:17,560 --> 00:27:18,320
Impossible.

604
00:27:19,000 --> 00:27:20,400
We have a lot of training tasks lately,

605
00:27:20,400 --> 00:27:21,160
and no leave is allowed.

606
00:27:22,320 --> 00:27:24,800
I'm guessing that kid staged it all himself.

607
00:27:25,320 --> 00:27:26,320
For his own gain,

608
00:27:26,320 --> 00:27:27,480
he'd do anything.

609
00:27:28,160 --> 00:27:29,960
What is wrong with people these days?

610
00:27:32,320 --> 00:27:34,160
What's wrong? They just love stirring up trouble.

611
00:27:34,960 --> 00:27:36,600
Their values are twisted, their character is flawed.

612
00:27:36,760 --> 00:27:38,040
Some do it purely for profit.

613
00:27:38,960 --> 00:27:39,920
But don't worry.

614
00:27:40,320 --> 00:27:41,840
The internet is not outside the law.

615
00:27:42,040 --> 00:27:43,760
I believe the truth will eventually come to light.

616
00:27:48,400 --> 00:27:48,840
What is it,

617
00:27:51,280 --> 00:27:51,800
Staff Officer Liang?

618
00:27:52,440 --> 00:27:53,120
Thank you.

619
00:27:56,360 --> 00:27:56,960
You're welcome.

620
00:27:57,760 --> 00:27:59,640
I just can't stand how they act.

621
00:28:04,080 --> 00:28:04,880
Actually,

622
00:28:06,200 --> 00:28:07,520
I've owed you an apology.

623
00:28:09,680 --> 00:28:11,560
That day outside Wu Dongsheng's ward,

624
00:28:12,360 --> 00:28:13,640
I took my anger out on you.

625
00:28:14,320 --> 00:28:15,040
I was wrong.

626
00:28:17,360 --> 00:28:17,960
I'm sorry.

627
00:28:24,440 --> 00:28:25,480
I accept your apology.

628
00:28:28,120 --> 00:28:29,040
Have some water.

629
00:28:38,360 --> 00:28:39,200
Bro,

630
00:28:39,200 --> 00:28:40,000
I've already caught up with them.

631
00:28:40,560 --> 00:28:42,080
I'll send you a video later.

632
00:28:43,240 --> 00:28:44,960
I told you to stay out of this.

633
00:28:45,200 --> 00:28:46,520
Why go so far just to be nosy?

634
00:28:46,720 --> 00:28:47,920
Do you have too much time on your hands?

635
00:28:48,240 --> 00:28:49,680
I'm just curious

636
00:28:50,160 --> 00:28:52,240
to see if they staged it themselves,

637
00:28:52,240 --> 00:28:53,320
or if there really is a

638
00:28:53,320 --> 00:28:55,320
loyal brother willing to stick his neck out for you.

639
00:28:55,560 --> 00:28:57,240
Alright, I'm done talking. Hanging up.

640
00:29:10,000 --> 00:29:10,800
Guo Zijian

641
00:29:11,400 --> 00:29:13,640
Comrade Soldier, Guo Zijian.

642
00:29:13,640 --> 00:29:15,120
Battalion Commander Guo

643
00:29:15,120 --> 00:29:15,760
Comrade Soldier

644
00:29:16,360 --> 00:29:17,160
Battalion Commander Guo

645
00:29:17,200 --> 00:29:17,520
Stop right there.

646
00:29:17,560 --> 00:29:18,680
Guo Zijian

647
00:29:18,720 --> 00:29:19,440
Stop.

648
00:29:19,720 --> 00:29:20,960
Battalion Commander Guo

649
00:29:23,320 --> 00:29:24,320
Why are you here?

650
00:29:24,440 --> 00:29:26,120
I forced them to tell me your whereabouts.

651
00:29:26,120 --> 00:29:26,840
I'm warning you.

652
00:29:27,040 --> 00:29:27,880
When they get here,

653
00:29:27,880 --> 00:29:29,080
if you dare start anything, I'll call the police.

654
00:29:29,440 --> 00:29:30,440
Let's see how your dad deals with you.

655
00:29:35,120 --> 00:29:36,680
Guo Zijian

656
00:29:47,440 --> 00:29:48,720
One-legged brother.

657
00:29:49,320 --> 00:29:50,640
Who are you?

658
00:29:51,320 --> 00:29:53,080
Guo Zijian is my battalion commander.

659
00:29:54,240 --> 00:29:55,960
I'm Guo Zijian's soldier.

660
00:30:16,360 --> 00:30:17,320
Students.

661
00:30:19,160 --> 00:30:20,440
You probably don't know this,

662
00:30:22,080 --> 00:30:23,080
but a soldier

663
00:30:24,000 --> 00:30:26,160
values honor more than life itself.

664
00:30:27,200 --> 00:30:29,760
Making a joke out of military honor...

665
00:30:31,040 --> 00:30:32,920
You exploit a soldier's honor

666
00:30:33,640 --> 00:30:34,760
to get attention,

667
00:30:35,760 --> 00:30:38,120
to gain followers and views.

668
00:30:39,000 --> 00:30:40,320
In doing so, you're not just destroying

669
00:30:40,320 --> 00:30:42,320
an excellent officer's career,

670
00:30:43,280 --> 00:30:45,200
you're also destroying your own conscience.

671
00:30:49,880 --> 00:30:52,160
You live in a peaceful era now.

672
00:30:53,520 --> 00:30:55,240
You lack for nothing.

673
00:30:56,360 --> 00:30:58,080
But do you realize that

674
00:30:59,040 --> 00:31:00,960
for the sake of our happy lives,

675
00:31:02,600 --> 00:31:04,520
many young soldiers

676
00:31:05,480 --> 00:31:07,000
didn't even live to be your age

677
00:31:07,040 --> 00:31:08,800
before laying down their lives?

678
00:31:12,480 --> 00:31:13,920
You are so young.

679
00:31:15,800 --> 00:31:18,360
What are you doing?

680
00:31:21,800 --> 00:31:23,560
You need to have some decency.

681
00:31:25,520 --> 00:31:28,840
And know when enough is enough.

682
00:31:29,560 --> 00:31:32,360
Stop this, students.

683
00:31:34,200 --> 00:31:36,920
Stop sensationalizing this issue.

684
00:31:40,400 --> 00:31:42,760
Comrade Veteran, we were wrong.

685
00:31:43,640 --> 00:31:44,480
We're sorry.

686
00:31:45,720 --> 00:31:47,920
I apologize to you and your commander.

687
00:31:49,760 --> 00:31:51,720
I've said all I need to say.

688
00:31:52,880 --> 00:31:54,640
You'd better watch yourselves.

689
00:32:13,760 --> 00:32:14,600
Wait.

690
00:32:15,640 --> 00:32:17,240
Who do you think you are?

691
00:32:18,920 --> 00:32:19,640
Give it back.

692
00:32:19,640 --> 00:32:20,000
That's enough.

693
00:32:20,000 --> 00:32:20,520
Give it back.

694
00:32:20,520 --> 00:32:21,000
That's enough.

695
00:32:21,000 --> 00:32:22,120
Give it back to me!

696
00:32:22,360 --> 00:32:23,520
Wait, I...

697
00:32:36,640 --> 00:32:37,440
Commander.

698
00:32:38,480 --> 00:32:39,200
Where are you?

699
00:32:39,760 --> 00:32:40,560
I'm back in my hometown.

700
00:32:41,400 --> 00:32:43,000
I opened that little shop, remember?

701
00:32:44,160 --> 00:32:44,960
What's up, Commander?

702
00:32:45,000 --> 00:32:45,640
Do you need something?

703
00:32:45,680 --> 00:32:46,680
Still lying to me.

704
00:32:46,800 --> 00:32:47,920
I already saw you.

705
00:32:48,640 --> 00:32:50,280
I have people near the park.

706
00:32:50,640 --> 00:32:52,040
I just came to restock some goods.

707
00:32:52,280 --> 00:32:54,760
And deal with those brats while I'm at it.

708
00:32:55,040 --> 00:32:57,080
They've never known hardship or suffering.

709
00:32:57,120 --> 00:32:58,000
They need to be taught a lesson.

710
00:32:59,760 --> 00:33:01,200
Send me your address, I'll pick you up.

711
00:33:01,760 --> 00:33:02,480
Forget it.

712
00:33:03,080 --> 00:33:05,040
I'm almost at the train station anyway.

713
00:33:05,520 --> 00:33:06,600
I won't trouble you.

714
00:33:09,760 --> 00:33:10,920
How's business?

715
00:33:11,040 --> 00:33:12,480
Booming!

716
00:33:13,080 --> 00:33:14,160
But don't worry, Commander.

717
00:33:14,800 --> 00:33:16,440
The things I promised you...

718
00:33:16,920 --> 00:33:18,200
I haven't neglected them one bit.

719
00:33:20,000 --> 00:33:22,040
Let me know anytime if you need anything.

720
00:33:22,480 --> 00:33:24,720
You don't need to tell me that, Commander. Don't worry.

721
00:33:26,920 --> 00:33:27,840
Commander.

722
00:33:29,000 --> 00:33:30,280
Take good care of yourself.

723
00:33:30,920 --> 00:33:33,640
Don't take things too hard.

724
00:33:35,080 --> 00:33:36,560
There's no hurdle you can't overcome.

725
00:33:37,320 --> 00:33:39,640
Cut the crap. Do I need your advice?

726
00:33:40,720 --> 00:33:41,720
You take care too.

727
00:33:42,080 --> 00:33:42,840
Okay.

728
00:34:17,520 --> 00:34:18,159
Old Liang,

729
00:34:19,080 --> 00:34:20,239
As for the New-Type Combat Forces'

730
00:34:20,760 --> 00:34:21,880
key personnel training,

731
00:34:22,520 --> 00:34:24,840
It was the Army and Theater Army Command

732
00:34:24,840 --> 00:34:26,719
leaders at both levels who personally handpicked you.

733
00:34:27,360 --> 00:34:28,760
So just go ahead and act boldly.

734
00:34:29,080 --> 00:34:31,120
Come to me anytime you face difficulties.

735
00:34:31,600 --> 00:34:33,719
I'll act as your Logistics Director.

736
00:34:34,679 --> 00:34:36,760
Your rank is too high for a Logistics Director.

737
00:34:36,760 --> 00:34:37,480
I wouldn't dare.

738
00:34:39,600 --> 00:34:40,639
I know

739
00:34:41,040 --> 00:34:43,679
you've always been prepared for this task.

740
00:34:44,520 --> 00:34:45,400
Same as always,

741
00:34:45,880 --> 00:34:48,120
I'll assign Xu Lingjun from the Operations and Training Department to you,

742
00:34:48,239 --> 00:34:49,880
to fully cooperate with you

743
00:34:50,199 --> 00:34:52,040
until this task is completely wrapped up.

744
00:34:53,360 --> 00:34:54,400
You're being so generous this time.

745
00:34:55,440 --> 00:34:56,480
You're going to do great things.

746
00:34:56,800 --> 00:34:58,080
Of course we have to be generous.

747
00:34:58,720 --> 00:35:00,800
This time, we'll provide whatever personnel you need,

748
00:35:00,800 --> 00:35:02,800
and whatever policies you require.

749
00:35:04,920 --> 00:35:06,160
With the commanders being so supportive,

750
00:35:06,160 --> 00:35:07,400
we will definitely give it our all.

751
00:35:07,600 --> 00:35:08,080
Good.

752
00:35:08,520 --> 00:35:10,080
Then hurry up and get started.

753
00:35:10,160 --> 00:35:12,400
Strive to make this pilot a model.

754
00:35:13,000 --> 00:35:13,560
Yes, sir.

755
00:35:15,120 --> 00:35:16,080
Thank you, Logistics Director.

756
00:35:16,760 --> 00:35:17,280
I'm off.

757
00:35:17,320 --> 00:35:18,000
Alright.

758
00:35:21,400 --> 00:35:21,800
Commander.

759
00:35:22,200 --> 00:35:23,200
You wanted to see me?

760
00:35:25,160 --> 00:35:26,640
My transfer orders came through.

761
00:35:26,720 --> 00:35:29,040
The research institute wants me to report to Beijing ASAP.

762
00:35:30,280 --> 00:35:31,480
Is the research project finished?

763
00:35:31,600 --> 00:35:32,480
Basically completed.

764
00:35:33,120 --> 00:35:33,720
Very good.

765
00:35:33,960 --> 00:35:35,040
You've made your mark.

766
00:35:35,720 --> 00:35:37,200
Keep up the good work when you get there.

767
00:35:37,680 --> 00:35:38,520
When do you leave?

768
00:35:40,080 --> 00:35:41,360
I want to wait a while longer.

769
00:35:43,200 --> 00:35:43,800
Why?

770
00:35:44,800 --> 00:35:46,200
I want to participate in the Group Army's

771
00:35:46,200 --> 00:35:47,560
key training for New-Type Combat Forces.

772
00:35:48,920 --> 00:35:50,240
Once I join the institute,

773
00:35:50,440 --> 00:35:52,400
direct frontline opportunities like this

774
00:35:52,400 --> 00:35:53,520
will never come around again.

775
00:35:53,920 --> 00:35:56,160
What I lack most is battlefield awareness.

776
00:35:56,960 --> 00:35:58,480
So I want to use this training

777
00:35:58,480 --> 00:36:00,000
to learn and make up for my shortcomings.

778
00:36:00,480 --> 00:36:01,280
I understand.

779
00:36:02,120 --> 00:36:03,440
But what about the institute?

780
00:36:05,040 --> 00:36:06,640
I've already explained it to them.

781
00:36:06,640 --> 00:36:08,720
I told them my mentor here

782
00:36:08,720 --> 00:36:10,560
might still have tasks for me to complete.

783
00:36:10,560 --> 00:36:12,200
So I plan to finish them

784
00:36:12,200 --> 00:36:13,200
before heading over as soon as possible.

785
00:36:13,560 --> 00:36:14,880
Oh, you cheeky girl.

786
00:36:15,200 --> 00:36:16,520
Using your mentor as an excuse.

787
00:36:19,440 --> 00:36:20,240
Alright.

788
00:36:20,880 --> 00:36:22,920
I'll coordinate so you can join the training.

789
00:36:22,920 --> 00:36:23,880
Yes, sir. Wait.

790
00:36:24,600 --> 00:36:26,200
I remember you once said

791
00:36:26,200 --> 00:36:27,800
that our Group Army's hardware and software

792
00:36:27,800 --> 00:36:28,840
weren't good enough for you.

793
00:36:29,880 --> 00:36:31,520
That's only because

794
00:36:31,880 --> 00:36:34,520
the Theater Army Command pilot is only in your army.

795
00:36:34,560 --> 00:36:36,160
Don't other units have it?

796
00:36:36,400 --> 00:36:39,080
You cheeky girl, taking all the benefits

797
00:36:39,400 --> 00:36:41,240
without saying a single nice word about us.

798
00:36:42,000 --> 00:36:43,280
Our 8th Group Army

799
00:36:43,280 --> 00:36:45,440
is at the forefront of military reform.

800
00:36:45,440 --> 00:36:46,520
Okay, okay, okay.

801
00:36:46,520 --> 00:36:47,320
That's too grating.

802
00:36:47,320 --> 00:36:48,400
Alright, you don't mean a word of it.

803
00:36:48,400 --> 00:36:49,080
I get it.

804
00:36:49,080 --> 00:36:49,760
Dismissed.

805
00:36:50,320 --> 00:36:51,000
There is one more thing.

806
00:36:51,400 --> 00:36:52,360
What else is there?

807
00:36:54,400 --> 00:36:56,200
That incident trending online lately...

808
00:36:56,200 --> 00:36:57,120
Have you heard about it?

809
00:36:58,600 --> 00:36:59,160
Guo Zijian.

810
00:36:59,440 --> 00:36:59,960
Yes.

811
00:36:59,960 --> 00:37:00,920
Such a huge incident,

812
00:37:01,200 --> 00:37:02,640
it'd be hard not to know.

813
00:37:04,520 --> 00:37:05,520
What do you want to ask?

814
00:37:05,920 --> 00:37:07,440
I want to know if this training

815
00:37:07,440 --> 00:37:08,400
will include Guo Zijian.

816
00:37:08,920 --> 00:37:09,600
What do you think?

817
00:37:09,840 --> 00:37:10,440
No.

818
00:37:10,600 --> 00:37:11,240
Then why ask?

819
00:37:14,120 --> 00:37:15,560
I just think that

820
00:37:15,960 --> 00:37:18,240
given Comrade Guo Zijian's overall qualities,

821
00:37:18,680 --> 00:37:20,760
if he has no spot in this training,

822
00:37:20,760 --> 00:37:22,280
he will regret it for the rest of his life.

823
00:37:22,760 --> 00:37:25,280
It'd also be a loss for the Group Army.

824
00:37:27,160 --> 00:37:29,480
Guo Zijian is currently suspended.

825
00:37:30,160 --> 00:37:31,600
As for when he'll be reinstated,

826
00:37:32,240 --> 00:37:33,600
or if he will be at all,

827
00:37:34,160 --> 00:37:36,200
we must wait until the investigation ends

828
00:37:36,200 --> 00:37:37,320
before making a conclusion.

829
00:37:37,600 --> 00:37:38,240
But...

830
00:37:39,120 --> 00:37:41,440
the New-Type Combat Forces training can't wait for him.

831
00:37:42,200 --> 00:37:43,200
Then what if this incident

832
00:37:43,200 --> 00:37:44,640
is never fully investigated?

833
00:37:44,680 --> 00:37:45,960
How will he be dealt with?

834
00:37:46,000 --> 00:37:46,880
Are you just going to leave him hanging?

835
00:37:48,000 --> 00:37:49,280
That's not for you to ask.

836
00:37:51,680 --> 00:37:52,520
Commander,

837
00:37:54,120 --> 00:37:55,880
I just hope our unit

838
00:37:55,880 --> 00:37:57,760
doesn't lose an excellent commander.

839
00:37:59,520 --> 00:38:00,960
Look at you, girl.

840
00:38:02,000 --> 00:38:03,960
You usually look down on everyone.

841
00:38:04,520 --> 00:38:06,880
Why are you treating Guo Zijian

842
00:38:06,880 --> 00:38:08,080
differently this time?

843
00:38:10,800 --> 00:38:13,280
That's probably because of the old saying:

844
00:38:13,640 --> 00:38:15,120
"Heroes recognize heroes."

845
00:38:18,200 --> 00:38:19,200
Alright.

846
00:38:19,720 --> 00:38:20,480
I get it.

847
00:38:21,000 --> 00:38:22,400
You can go now, hero.

848
00:38:22,920 --> 00:38:23,640
Yes, sir.

849
00:38:39,360 --> 00:38:40,200
Even though

850
00:38:40,760 --> 00:38:42,200
merits and faults are weighed separately,

851
00:38:43,800 --> 00:38:44,520
that kick of yours

852
00:38:45,120 --> 00:38:47,000
had to happen at such a critical juncture.

853
00:38:48,240 --> 00:38:48,560
Normally,

854
00:38:49,080 --> 00:38:51,000
the core training for New-Type Combat Forces

855
00:38:51,440 --> 00:38:52,160
and saving lives

856
00:38:52,480 --> 00:38:54,880
are completely unrelated.

857
00:38:56,200 --> 00:38:57,640
You really are something.

858
00:38:58,080 --> 00:38:59,000
With a single kick,

859
00:38:59,240 --> 00:39:00,320
